                + "(verified to 3.5e-18) — and a BALANCED PUMP-AND-DRAIN (exactly 50.0000 % of ‖s‖₁ = 0.48675 injecting, 50.0000 % extracting; max|s| = 0.01866667; count-neutral, three-point local). PHYSICAL: the FEEDBACK CONTROLLER (sense ρ "
