        new("rho-identity", "Rho Identity", "What remains as the identity of ρ once the laboratory |ψ|² reading is excluded: the occupancy measure — a dimensionless counting measure whose content is entirely in the arrangement.", TheoryLayer.Physics, TheoryClassification.Derived, TheoryObjectKind.Derivation,
            ["metric-coupling", "watch-ontology"],
            Narrative: "After G_017 excluded the identification of a LABORATORY |ψ|² with ρ, which physical quantity REMAINS as the IDENTITY of ρ? THE CRITERION (no external physics enters it): Q is the identity of ρ iff (I1) it is defined by COUNTING over distinguishable states — Difference → distinguishability only; (I2) it is DIMENSIONLESS and normalised (Σ = 1) or a ratio of such; (I3) it SURVIVES G_017, its definition never having referenced a laboratory quantity; (I4) it DETERMINES ρ and is not a lossy functional of it (G_016/G_016b: functionals are readouts). PROVENANCE LEDGER: this audit imports NO constant at all — no SI quantity, no measured number, no laboratory system; every assertion is a dimension count, an exact invariance, or a witness built from the primitives, in deliberate contrast to G_015/G_017 which imported G, c, the finesse, Q and the polarizability and were thereby falsifiable. DERIVED — THE OCCUPANCY MEASURE: 96 cells, A₀ = 45 eigenspaces, free room Σ(m−1) = 51, state affine dimension N − 1 = 95, with Σρ = 1 and ρ_min > 0 for every configuration. I3 is the pivot: nothing in 'ρ = counting' was ever a laboratory number, so G_017 removed an IDENTIFICATION rather than the quantity. I4 holds trivially and uniquely because it IS ρ — zero loss (L1(witness, witness) = 0) while L1(witness, uniform) = 0.6666666666666667 — unlike every other candidate. REFUTED — THE ACTUALIZATION COUNT IS A LABEL: scale invariance (G_009), verified exactly, gives the field max|a| = 0.6031746016455657 and the clock separation 0.9985774245179969 identically at scales 1, 1e3, 1e−6 and 96, and ρ_i/ρ_j = (7ρ_i)/(7ρ_j) exactly, so every observable is a RATIO and ratios are scale-free: the count N·ρ carries ZERO physical content. DERIVED CONTENT / BOUNDARY DIMENSION — THE DEGENERACY OCCUPANCY: the within-multiplet distribution is EXACTLY the part of ρ the energy functional cannot see (ΔE = 0 exactly for the canonical witness; a 0.012 transfer inside an m = 6 multiplet leaves |ΔE| < 1e-13). It is 51/95 = 53.6842 % of the state invisible to everything except arrangement against 94/95 = 98.9474 % invisible to energy, with the λ-mixing room 43 and the energy direction 1; multiplicities are one of 6, one of 5, forty-two of 2 and one of 1, giving A₀ = 45. It is DERIVED as content while its dimension 51 = Σ(m−1) is BOUNDARY, inherited from the D96 lattice — the project's two-level rule (D_028/D_040). REFUTED — THE SURVIVOR DISTRIBUTION IS A LOSSY READOUT: the per-multiplet totals keep 44 of 95 dimensions, discarding EXACTLY the 51-dimensional free room, and E = ⟨λ,ρ⟩ keeps 1 of 95, discarding 94; survivor compaction MOVES E (|ΔE| > 1e-3) so it is not even energy-blind; and decisively two DIFFERENT states share the same survivor data (a within-multiplet 1e-6 transfer leaves the block sums identical to 1e-12 while L1 > 0), so a lossy functional cannot be the identity. BOUNDARY — STATE ACCESSIBILITY IS THE LATTICE: A₀ and the free room N − A₀ computed with no reference to ρ give K = 1 → 49/47, K = 2 → 47/49, K = 3 → 45/51, K = 4 → 47/49, K = 5 → 45/51, K = 6 → 45/51, and the SAME uniform ρ exists for every lattice (L1 = 0), so accessibility does NOT determine ρ: it is a CAPACITY input (G_007) that BOUNDS what ρ can reach without being ρ, its dynamical face being G_005's SUPPRESSED and G_008's STABLE/METASTABLE/SUPPRESSED. WHAT REMAINS: ρ is an ARRANGEMENT — a dimensionless counting measure whose physical meaning is entirely in the SHAPE of the occupancy and none of it in its SIZE, whose surviving content is the energy-invisible 51-dimensional degeneracy structure and whose other 43 dimensions mix distinct weights with zero net; nothing in that statement refers to energy, mass, intensity or a Born probability. THE HONEST LIMIT: importing no constant makes this the MOST AT-NATIVE audit of the group and correspondingly UNFALSIFIABLE BY ITSELF — its falsifiable content lives entirely in the BOUNDARY identifications, and G_017 excluded the laboratory one. The resulting PROVENANCE ASYMMETRY is the group's real methodological finding: combinatorial/invariance audits (G_001, G_002, G_005–G_008, G_011–G_014, G_016, G_016b, G_018) import nothing and yield DERIVED structure but are not falsifiable alone, while boundary-identified audits (G_003, G_004, G_009, G_010, G_015, G_017) import G, c, GM/R, finesse, Q, polarizability and 1e-18, are falsifiable, and where testable have been EXCLUDED or shown to be a RANK-1 SHADOW. So AT's identity content is COMBINATORIAL, and it becomes physics only when a boundary identification is supplied. No reclassification; D_040 untouched; no canonical claim, value or equation changes; no new primitive.",
            Formula: "I1..I4;  occupancy measure;  sizes are scale-free;  51/95 = 53.6842 % pure arrangement;  zero imported constants",
            CalculationId: "rho-identity",
            References: ["ResearchY-G_018", "ResearchY-G_017", "ResearchY-G_016", "ResearchY-G_009"],
