        new("temporal-independence-audit", "Temporal Independence Audit", "Which G-results survive if the conformal metric is removed? SURVIVES: 25 of 36 need g00 only (the entire density era G_001-G_020), 8 need g_ij and 3 require conformal flatness; the boundary is exactly G_020 -> G_021 and the minimal time sector is 1 metric function + 1 scalar + 1 exponent, with no eta.", TheoryLayer.Physics, TheoryClassification.Derived, TheoryObjectKind.Derivation,
            ["conformal-assumption-audit", "clock-sector-closure", "no-go-audit", "spatial-origin-audit", "literal-verdict-audit"],
            Narrative: "Which G-results survive if the CONFORMAL metric is removed? Review G_001-G_034 and classify each result by whether it requires g00 ONLY, g_rr, or CONFORMAL FLATNESS. Goal: identify the MINIMAL TIME SECTOR of AT. ANSWER: SURVIVES. " +
            "THE CLASSIFICATION (36 suites, 25 / 8 / 3). SURVIVES (g00 only) 25 of 36; BOUNDARY (g_ij needed, conformality not) 8; REFUTED (requires A = B) 3. The axis maps 1:1 onto the output labels, so the verdict is not a judgement call: a result requiring only g00 cannot be affected by removing conformality, because it never refers to the spatial block at all. " +
            "THE SHARP BOUNDARY - G_020 -> G_021. EVERY audit from G_001 to G_020 is g00-ONLY. The whole density era - the source law, the clock law, control and realizability, the SI magnitudes, the calibration, the suppression mechanism, the actuation chain, the mass-independence and watch-ontology results, the second-order signature and the neutron-star redshift - uses g00 = -rho^(2/d) AND NOTHING ELSE. The spatial requirement begins EXACTLY at G_021 (Light-Propagation), the first audit to ask for light bending. The conformal boundary is therefore the step from G_020 to G_021 - computed from the registry (boundary index 23 of 36; temporal era 22 entries), never chosen. The BOUNDARY eight are G_021, G_022, G_023, G_025, G_028, G_029, G_030, G_033; the REFUTED three are G_024, G_031, G_032; the metric-free three are G_026, G_027, G_034. " +
            "THE MINIMAL TIME SECTOR. 1 metric function (g00 = -rho^(2/d)) + 1 scalar (rho) + 1 exponent (1/d, d = 3 by rotation self-duality, M_013) - with NO SPATIAL METRIC, NO CONFORMAL FACTOR AND NO REFERENCE eta. The source law and the clock law are ONE STATEMENT: A = 0.5 ln(-g00) = sigma = (1/d) ln rho is the clock potential (= Phi/c^2); dtau/dt = sqrt(-g00) = rho^(1/d) is the clock; and a = -(1/d) grad ln rho = -grad A is the source law - the NEGATIVE gradient of the time exponent, exactly as an attractive force requires. The theory's time half is ONE EQUATION ON ONE SCALAR. " +
            "THE ARITY PROOF (structural, not numerical). The temporal observables are functions whose SIGNATURE CONTAINS NO B: G00(double rho), ClockOf(double rho), ClockPotentialOf(double rho), RedshiftOf(double rho), SourceAccelerationOf(double[] rhoField), SecondOrderRatioOf(double x). The spatial observables DO take B: GammaOf(double a, double b), AdmittedBand(double x), SurvivorB(double x). A RESULT THAT CANNOT BE CALLED WITH B CANNOT REQUIRE B. Verified against the recorded results: g00, the clock, the redshift (e^0.247002 - 1), G_019's discriminator e^x/sqrt(1+2x) = 1 + x^2 - (4/3)x^3, the source law as the EXACT central difference of -A, and INWARD acceleration on a PEAKED profile with the peak as an equilibrium (the attractive-force property). " +
            "THE MECHANICAL CHECK, AND ITS HONEST LIMITS. The registry is checked against a LIVE SCAN of the group-G sources with COMMENTS AND STRING LITERALS STRIPPED, so a narrative mention cannot mask a dependency (G_019's only spatial hit was a report sentence and disappears under stripping). TWO PATTERNS WERE REMOVED AFTER MEASUREMENT because they matched non-metric code and would have made the safety rule meaningless: 'double b' matched a LEAST-SQUARES SLOPE (G_006) and a TRIDIAGONAL PARAMETER (G_007, G_016b), and 'K(' matched any method of that name. Bare 'psi' is EXCLUDED ON PURPOSE: it names the WAVEFUNCTION in the density era (|psi|^2 = rho, G_014) and the metric's traceless face elsewhere. RULE ADOPTED: a token qualifies as a marker only if it cannot plausibly mean anything else. TWO claims declare ScanDetectsIt = false WITH WRITTEN REASONS - G_025 (its dependence is an EXPONENT in rho*exp(-d*psi/(d-1)), and psi is unusable as a marker) and G_033 (the suite contains NO metric vocabulary at all, 0/0/0, because its argument is group-theoretic, T2g). CHECK STRENGTH IS TWO-DIRECTIONAL: HARD (asserted) - a ClockOnly result must have ZERO executable spatial references, which holds for all 25; SOFT - a spatial/conformal result should show at least one, unless explicitly triaged. " +
            "WHAT THIS BUYS. G_031 showed conformal flatness IS the counting measure; G_032 showed it is an ASSUMED PRIMITIVE eta and that imposing it is REFUTED (gamma = -1, Cassini 8.6957e4 sigma). G_035 shows the cost is CONFINED: THE CONFORMAL PROBLEM IS CONFINED TO THE SPATIAL SECTOR, AND AT'S TIME HALF IS NOT HOSTAGE TO ITS SPACE HALF. The dilemma is real but it is ABOUT SPACE - nothing in the source, the clock, the density control, the actuation chain or the redshift results moves when the spatial metric is discarded. " +
            "OUTPUT: SURVIVES - 25 of 36 results need g00 and nothing else; the minimal time sector is non-empty, self-consistent, and every temporal observable is B-free. The verdict is COMPUTED (the G_027 discipline). " +
            "No reclassification; D_040 untouched; 6/6 PASSED, group G 277/277. VERDICTS: DERIVED / BOUNDARY / REFUTED.",
