        new("electromagnetism-inventory-audit", "Electromagnetism Inventory Audit", "What electromagnetic structure does AT actually have? BOUNDARY: the KINEMATICS is derived (U(1) as Z_96, 1+3+8 = 12, topological charge, emergent c) while the DYNAMICS is declared but never computed - the Noether currents, F^a_mu_nu, -1/4 F^2 and the full Lagrangian all exist as STRING-returning members; the sourced Maxwell equation and any spin-1 wave equation are missing; U(1) has two incompatible origins and alpha has two values.", TheoryLayer.Physics, TheoryClassification.Boundary, TheoryObjectKind.Derivation,
            ["gauge-sector-origin", "gauge-dynamics-origin", "conformal-assumption-audit", "literal-verdict-audit"],
