            "A FIRST DRAFT OF THIS AUDIT WAS WRONG, AND THE LIVE SCAN CAUGHT IT. The draft claimed the EM dynamics was simply ABSENT - no current, no kinetic term, no Lagrangian. FALSE. ResearchXH/LagrangianOrigin.cs (QG244) contains ALL of them: the Noether currents J^mu_em / J^mu_W / J^mu_s, the field strength F^a_mu_nu = d_mu A^a_nu - d_nu A^a_mu + g f^abc A^b_mu A^c_nu, the kinetic term L_gauge = -(1/4) F^a F^a, the covariant derivative D_mu, the matter term, and the full density L = -(1/4)F^a F^a + i psi-bar gamma^mu D_mu psi - m psi-bar psi. EVERY ONE IS A MEMBER RETURNING A STRING, verified mechanically by EmDynamicsIsStringReturning(). And DerivationsThatAreConjunctions() shows the declaring booleans are conjunctions of other audits' predicates: NoetherCurrentsExist() => EnergyConservationViaNoether() && CurrentsConserved(); QedLagrangianDerived() => QedEquationDerived() && AlphaEmMatches137() && GeneratorAlgebraCloses(). " +
