            "CONSERVATION IS NOT THE FIELD EQUATION. What QG243 offers as its derived field equation is the current CONSERVATION d_mu J^mu = 0 - kinematic, implied by the symmetry. The SOURCED Maxwell equation d_mu F^mu_nu = J^nu is NEVER written and NEVER solved, and no massless SPIN-1 wave equation exists (AT's only massless wave equation is the SPIN-2 Fierz-Pauli Box psi_mu_nu = 0 of the gravity sector). Nothing makes the photon propagate. " +
