            Narrative: "REFUTED: no measurable quantity retains all 95 dimensions of rho, and the ceiling is a symmetry theorem rather than a detector limitation. Every operator AT can construct commutes with the substrate's dihedral symmetry (192 permutations, built and checked in code: distinct, closed, transitive), so the observables live in the centralizer algebra - dimension 49, the number of ORBITALS, computed four independent ways (brute-force enumeration of all 9216 ordered cell pairs; Burnside (1/|G|) fix(g)^2 = 9408/192; the multiplicity-free irrep decomposition, 49 irreps each appearing once; and the sum over the 45 levels of the algebra's restricted rank, 1 + 42*1 + 3 + 3). A 49-dimensional operator algebra acting on a 95-dimensional state space leaves 47 dimensions unreachable, and the audit NAMES them: the real state splits as 48 magnitudes + 47 intra-doublet ORIENTATIONS, one angle per two-dimensional irrep, and D96 has exactly 47 of those. By Schur's lemma a centralizer operator is a scalar inside each irrep, so no constructible observable can see them. The resolution ladder is computed on a recomputed spectrum (96 cells, 45 levels, {1:1,2:42,5:1,6:1}, trace 1152, state space 95): site-addressed cell counts retain 95, loss 0 - but that IS rho, and naming every cell is what G_017 excluded; distance-class contractions <rho, A_d rho> retain 48, loss 47 - the ceiling for anything AT can build; spectral level populations retain 44, loss 51 - EXACTLY G_039's free room Sum(m-1) = 96 - 45, so the two audits meet on the same number. The 4 dimensions the contraction rung reclaims are the only two multi-irrep levels (m = 5 and m = 6, three irreps each). Two witnesses make invertibility fail exactly rather than statistically: rotating one doublet's orientation by 1.1 rad - orthogonal inside the irrep, so it preserves the sum and every level norm - moves the state by 1.997e-1 in L1 on a contrasty state (6.93e-3 on the flat generic state) while moving EVERY contraction by at most 2.78e-17; and all 192 group images of a generic state report ONE distinct reading (spread 3.12e-17) while sitting up to 9.23e-2 apart, a fibre of at least 192-to-1. Regime caveat, self-caught: the retained dimension is a GENERIC-STATE statement - a state confined to four channels collapses to rank 4 - so both regimes are asserted. FIVE SLIPS CAUGHT AND RECORDED, NOT ABSORBED: a rank threshold must be relative to the WHOLE matrix, not to each row (a per-row tolerance accepted a row of pure roundoff - A_24 restricted to channel 1 is exactly zero since 2cos(2*pi*24/96) = 0, so its 2.8e-32 norm exceeded 1e-8 times itself - which read every doublet as rank 2 and summed the 45 levels to 143 instead of 49); a level's real block is ONE cos/sin pair per channel (a per-mode guard doubles the +-k pair and the 'projector' is not idempotent, |P^2 - P| = 1/24); a level projector lives in the MODE basis, not a cell-indexed mask; the witness must use the INVARIANT contraction <rho, A_d rho>, not the equivariant vector A_d rho (which the group permutes and which showed a spurious 2.1e-2 'difference'); and the regime caveat. OUTPUT: REFUTED. The verdict is COMPUTED from floor checks, never a literal. Registry: added as ClockOnly -> SURVIVES, triaged ScanDetectsIt: false; counts become 27/11/3 of 41; boundary index unchanged. No reclassification: G_039's BOUNDARY verdict STANDS - G_040 explains its measurability finding rather than revising it. G_016/G_016b/G_017/G_018/G_035 unchanged inputs; D_040 untouched; no canonical claim, value or equation changes; no new primitive. G_033's live classifier now reads 22 substrate suites (39 classified in total), because this suite recomputes the D96 ring spectrum. 9/9 PASSED, group G 313/313. VERDICTS: DERIVED (the centralizer dimension four ways; the ladder; the 48 magnitudes + 47 orientations split) / FALSIFIED (the orientation witnesses; every candidate that claimed the whole space) / POSTULATED (the boundary: the 47 are recoverable only by naming every cell, which G_017 excluded).",
            Formula: "centralizer dim = #orbitals = 49 = (1/|G|) Sum fix(g)^2 = 9408/192 = Sum m_lambda^2 (multiplicity-free) = Sum over levels of restricted rank (1 + 42*1 + 3 + 3); state space 95 = 48 magnitudes + 47 orientations; spectral loss = Sum(m-1) = 51 = G_039's free room; contraction loss = 47 = #doublets; protected = 230 - 49 = 181",
