            AuditIds: ["g040"]),        new("rho-realization-audit", "Rho Realization Audit", "What observable can carry rho while remaining compatible with G_016/G_016b/G_017/G_018/G_035? BOUNDARY: four of five requirements met by computation and one carrier identified, but measurability is unmet. The spectrum is RECOMPUTED (45 distinct levels, histogram {1:1,2:42,5:1,6:1}, free room 51, state dimension 95, trace 1152) and all four figures reproduce the record. Energy and entropy are each ONE number on a 95-dimensional space, so each is lossy by 94 = 51 within-multiplet + 43 level mixing; the witness moves NO energy while shifting the clock by 86277 s/day, and two distinct states share H = ln 2 exactly. Phase is separated sectorially (rho counts sites, the phase lives on links). The candidates are decided by LOSS: occupancy/attractor/survivor are zero-loss and are ONE object, while state populations and degeneracy occupation discard the 51-dimensional free room. Measurability is the binding requirement, because the realization question differs from G_018's identity question.", TheoryLayer.Physics, TheoryClassification.Boundary, TheoryObjectKind.Derivation,
