            Formula: "E = <lambda, rho>; energy kernel dim 94 = 51 (within-multiplet) + 43 (level mixing); H = ln 2 for two distinct rho; (1/d) ln 20 = 0.9985774245 = 86277.089 s/day; free room Sum(m-1) = 51 = 96 - A0",
