        new("authored-verdict-audit", "Authored-Verdict Audit", "Is the G_025 defect class isolated? NO \u2014 it is SYSTEMIC. Four QG audits with IDENTICAL method names differed only in typed literals; their sub-scores never read their criteria; and their four test suites asserted CONTRADICTORY verdicts and all passed. The Born-rule headline classification was DEAD CODE. All five findings are now DERIVED from cited evidence.", TheoryLayer.Physics, TheoryClassification.Derived, TheoryObjectKind.Derivation,
