            "ROBUSTNESS DEFECT FOUND EN ROUTE: the alpha selection compared FORMATTED NUMBER STRINGS, which is CULTURE-DEPENDENT \u2014 a comma-decimal culture would silently collapse the classification. Now InvariantCulture plus a numeric comparison. " +
