        new("spatial-metric", "Spatial Metric", "Can a DERIVED spatial metric preserve the clock law, the source law and the acceleration law while reproducing gamma = +1? NO: the three laws are gamma-BLIND, and conformal flatness forces gamma = -1 for ANY factor. gamma = +1 needs reciprocal factors in the two sectors, which is a POSTULATE whose cost is a spatial volume measure of 1/rho. REFINES ResearchY-G_021.", TheoryLayer.Physics, TheoryClassification.Derived, TheoryObjectKind.Derivation,
