2) = -4 sigma in d = 3 (no finite solution in d = 2, consistent with G_uv = 0, QG180), and that psi = -4 sigma moves Phi to -3 sigma and therefore CHANGES THE SOURCING RELATION — psi is a minimal new primitive (QG24), not a free optics patch. With psi nonzero the clock law is dtau/dt = rho^(1/d) e^(psi), and e^(psi) enters at FIRST order — at psi = 1e-3 that is 1000.5x G_019's x^2 term — so any nonzero psi swamps the second-order signature. The whole G_001-G_020 chain used g00 only, so its results STAND. " +
