        new("g033", "Cubic Substrate Audit", "Does the gravitation/time search need D96^3 the way the rest of physics does? PARTIAL \u2014 gravity structurally requires the dimension-3 sector (the spatial metric's traceless part needs T2g, absent from a single D96 ring) but the metric era is substrate-free because the requirement was absorbed into the primitive eta",
